== CANON-17 (r3.64): Exists, DeleteFile and RenameFile are conveniences of
== Std.IOUtils; Std.Files alone does not declare them.
Module Diagnostics.FileUtilityNeedsIOUtils

Use Std.Files

Main :
    PutLn(Exists("x.txt"))
;
